{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/About_Title.png?t=1740734347\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wondered what it feels like to stop time? Ascend to ZERO is a time-control roguelike where you can use your unique ability to freeze time and fight your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version introduces the beginning of the story and offers a glimpse of the full gameplay experience.\u00a0Get ready for a rich experience in the full version, where  the world expands, and the challenges become more intense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time Action</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/About_TimeAction_2.gif?t=1740734347\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop time to dodge your enemies' attacks and gain the upper hand in combat. But be careful\u2014your ability is limited, and time is not on your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infinite Growth</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/About_Infinite_2.gif?t=1740734347\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each battle, you\u2019ll become dramatically stronger in mere seconds. Watch out for higher-level enemies, but when you take them down, the rewards are more than worth it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Replayability</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279910/extras/About_Replayability.png?t=1740734347\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills with every run and push your limits. Discover your unique playstyle and gather Tech Chips to build your perfect loadout.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279910?t=1740734347","background_raw":"https://sto